 "edits": [
  {
   "path": "sections.context.2.zh",
   "before": "一种解释是，他宁可错过一次得手的机会，也不让对方事后找到说辞。至于他当时怎么权衡，原文只记了这一句话，没有更多。",
   "after": "一种解释是，他宁可错过一次得手的机会，也不让对方事后找到说辞。至于他当时怎么权衡，本文所据材料只录了这一句，不作推测。",
   "issues": [
    "F1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "path": "sections.context.2.en",
   "before": "One reading of it is that he would rather let a chance of success slip by than give the other side a justification to use afterward. As for how he weighed the decision at the time, the source preserves only that single sentence and nothing more.",
   "after": "One reading of it is that he would rather let a chance of success slip by than give the other side a justification to use afterward. As for how he weighed the decision, the material used here gives only this line, and we do not speculate beyond it.",
   "issues": [
    "F1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "path": "sections.today.1.en",
   "before": "The other thing is to let the preparation be seen. Work up the evaluation of alternative suppliers, and cost out the timing of a switch; put it on the table in internal meetings, and where necessary let the other side see it too. When they know you can genuinely walk away, terms may loosen — or they may not, and that is the price to be paid.",
   "after": "The other thing is to let the preparation be seen. Work up the evaluation of alternative suppliers, and work out the timing and the cost of a switch; put it on the table in internal meetings, and where necessary let the other side see it too. When they know you can genuinely walk away, terms may loosen — or they may not, and that is the price to be paid.",
   "issues": [
    "F2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "path": "sections.limits.0.zh",
   "before": "本文只有一个史源，即《清史稿·左宗棠传》，成书在传主身后，所述与当时档案未必一致。奏疏与对话（如「先之以議論」「師不以正」）是史书的记述，未必是逐字原话。英文版引号内的文字是作者对古文的译述。",
   "after": "本文只有一个史源，即《清史稿·左宗棠传》，成书于1928年，所述与当时档案未必一致。奏疏与对话（如「先之以議論」「師不以正」）是史书的记述，未必是逐字原话。英文版引号内的文字是作者对古文的译述。",
