    "F3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "path": "sections.limits.0.en",
   "before": "This piece rests on a single source, the biography of Zuo Zongtang in the Draft History of the Qing, compiled after his death; its account may not match the archives of the time. The memorial and the dialogue — such as \"first take the matter up in negotiation\" and \"our army does not act from a position of right\" — are the history's rendering and may not be verbatim. Quoted passages in English are the author's translations of the classical Chinese.",
   "after": "This piece rests on a single source, the biography of Zuo Zongtang in the Draft History of the Qing, compiled in 1928; its account may not match the archives of the time. The memorial and the dialogue — such as \"first take the matter up in negotiation\" and \"our army does not act from a position of right\" — are the history's rendering and may not be verbatim. Quoted passages in English are the author's translations of the classical Chinese.",
   "issues": [
    "F3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "path": "uncertainty_note.zh",
   "before": "本文只据《清史稿·左宗棠传》一个史源，成书在传主身后，所述与当时档案未必一致；奏疏与对话是史书记述，未必逐字。编年照原文年号，数字照录不核；「俄亦懾我兵威」与「和議成」是并置叙述，因果未经证实；崇厚约文与曾纪泽改约内容原文未载，不作补写。",
   "after": "本文只据《清史稿·左宗棠传》一个史源，成书于1928年，所述与当时档案未必一致；奏疏与对话是史书记述，未必逐字。编年照原文年号，数字照录不核；「俄亦懾我兵威」与「和議成」是并置叙述，因果未经证实；崇厚约文与曾纪泽改约内容原文未载，不作补写。",
