   "path": "uncertainty_note.en",
   "before": "This piece relies on a single source, the biography of Zuo Zongtang in the Draft History of the Qing, compiled after his death, and its account may not match the archives of the time. The memorial and the dialogue are the history's renderings and may not be verbatim. Dates follow the original reign years; figures are copied as given and not checked. That \"Russia was awed by our military might\" and that \"peace was concluded\" appear side by side in the source, and the causal link is unproven. Chong Hou's treaty text and the substance of Zeng Jize's revision are not in the source and are not filled in here.",
   "after": "This piece relies on a single source, the biography of Zuo Zongtang in the Draft History of the Qing, compiled in 1928, and its account may not match the archives of the time. The memorial and the dialogue are the history's renderings and may not be verbatim. Dates follow the original reign years; figures are copied as given and not checked. That \"Russia was awed by our military might\" and that \"peace was concluded\" appear side by side in the source, and the causal link is unproven. Chong Hou's treaty text and the substance of Zeng Jize's revision are not in the source and are not filled in here.",
