  {
   "path": "sections.context.0.zh",
   "before": "先看这份奏疏落在什么样的局面里。帕夏能役使回众，通使结援英、俄，购买兵械自备；英人暗中相助，想让他别立一国，用以屏障俄国。俄方则以回众屡扰边境为由，出兵逐回，占了伊犁，还说要代取乌鲁木齐。",
   "after": "先看这份奏疏落在什么样的局面里。帕夏能役使回众，通使结援英、俄，购买兵械自备；英人暗中相助，想让他别立一国，用以屏障俄国。俄方则因回众屡扰其边境，出兵逐回，占了伊犁，还说要代取乌鲁木齐。",
   "issues": [
    "F6"
   ]
  },
  {
   "path": "sections.context.0.en",
   "before": "Start with the situation the memorial landed in. The Pasha could command the Muslim population, sent envoys to seek support from Britain and Russia, and bought weapons to arm his own forces. The British backed him quietly, hoping to see him set up a separate state that would stand as a shield against Russia. Russia, for its part, cited repeated raids against its border, sent troops to drive the raiders out, seized Ili, and announced that it would go on to take Urumqi on China's behalf.",
   "after": "Start with the situation the memorial landed in. The Pasha could command the Muslim population, sent envoys to seek support from Britain and Russia, and bought weapons to arm his own forces. The British backed him quietly, hoping to see him set up a separate state that would stand as a shield against Russia. Russia, for its part, because Muslim raiders repeatedly harassed its border, sent troops to drive them out, seized Ili, and announced that it would go on to take Urumqi on China's behalf.",
   "issues": [
    "F6"
   ]
